<%- include('partials/head', { meta: { title: 'Our Mission', description: 'Our mission is to help couples build and maintain greater love and health in their relationships — accessible to everyone.' } }) %>
<body class="page-body">
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85')"></div>
  <div class="page-hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="page-hero-content">
    <p class="t-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:14px">Who We Are</p>
    <h1 class="t-title-lg">Our <em>Mission</em></h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mission-grid">
  <div>
    <p class="t-eyebrow m-eyebrow on-light fade-up" style="margin-bottom:20px">The Foundation</p>
    <h2 class="t-title-md" style="color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:28px; font-family:var(--font-serif)" class="fade-up">
      Reaching couples everywhere.
    </h2>
    <p class="t-body-warm fade-up" style="margin-bottom:16px">It is our mission to reach out to couples in order to help create and maintain greater love and health in their relationships. We are committed to an ongoing program of events that increase the understanding of relationships and add to the development of solutions and tools for change.</p>
    <p class="t-body-warm fade-up" style="margin-bottom:16px">It is our goal to make our services accessible to the broadest reach of people across race, religion, class, culture, and ethnicity.</p>
    <p class="t-body-warm fade-up">We are committed to helping each other strengthen happy marriages and committed relationships — and support and repair troubled ones.</p>

    <div class="mission-values fade-up">
      <p class="mission-values-title">Our Commitments</p>
      <div class="values-list">
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🌿</div>
          <div class="value-text"><strong>Accessibility</strong>Our retreats are designed to be accessible across race, religion, class, culture, and ethnicity. Love doesn't discriminate — neither do we.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🔗</div>
          <div class="value-text"><strong>Ongoing growth</strong>We maintain a continuous program of events that deepen understanding and provide new tools for lasting change.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">❤️</div>
          <div class="value-text"><strong>All relationships welcome</strong>Whether your relationship is thriving and you want to go deeper, or it's struggling and you need support — there is a place for you here.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🌐</div>
          <div class="value-text"><strong>Eastern + western wisdom</strong>Our educators draw on both western psychology and eastern philosophical traditions to offer a rich and complete toolkit.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mission-photo fade-up delay-1">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516589178581-6cd7833ae3b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Couple on a journey together" loading="lazy">
    <div class="mission-photo-caption">
      "Because listening is the root to understanding."
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Founders note -->
<section style="background:var(--ink); padding:var(--section-pad) var(--gutter)">
  <div style="max-width:700px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center">
    <p class="t-eyebrow" style="justify-content:center; margin-bottom:24px">A Note on Our Philosophy</p>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem); font-weight:300; font-style:italic; line-height:1.55; color:var(--mist); margin-bottom:32px;">
      You never hear &ldquo;I want a divorce — my partner understands me.&rdquo; At the deepest level, most coupled individuals do not feel understood by their partner. Our work begins there.
    </p>
    <div style="width:40px; height:1px; background:var(--gold); margin:0 auto 24px"></div>
    <p class="t-body" style="max-width:520px; margin:0 auto 40px">
      Promises of honesty are kept not when we feel understood, but when we feel safe enough to be truly vulnerable. Our retreats create that safety.
    </p>
    <a href="/programming" class="btn btn-outline">Explore Our Programming</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<script src="/js/main.js?v=<%= site.version %>"></script>
</body>
</html>
